  "description": "Leon's a sweet, handsome guy who wants to experience all that life in the cosmos has to offer, along with his friends and adorable pup Alfie. His uptight and annoyingly-handsome friend Syrrik, however, wants to join the prestigious ranks of Starfleet as soon as possible - just as his father expects. But when a station-wide conspiracy threatens everything they know, Leon and Syrrik need to lean on each other in ways they might not expect! Will their friendship buckle under this pressure, or will it become something more?\nSource: Webtoon",
